  m_text: Heya! This map is super vibe coded! I normally like to put in a lot more
    effort and authorship into my work, but this was (as of writing) made in a week
    to show to my friends because I wasn't happy with current prop hunt maps! Plus
    I think even if you're using AI, practice makes perfect! None of the assets were
    diffusion generated (what most people would call "Generative AI") though, and
    below is a list of the awesome creators of the CC0 public domain asset packs
    that you should check out! Either if you need free assets or are looking to find
    awesome assets! Below is everything that was used for this project!
